<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>503 &ndash; Dienst nicht verf&uuml;gbar</title>
  <style>
    body { background: #14161c; color: #e6e6e6; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0; }
    .header { background: #009999; padding: 9px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; font-size: 17px; margin: 0; font-weight: normal; }
    .logo { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-right: 16px; }
    .container { max-width: 400px; margin: 72px auto; background: #1f232b; padding: 28px; border-radius: 3px; border-top: 3px solid #009999; }
    h2 { color: #7fd6d6; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0; }
    p.note { font-size: 12px; color: #9aa; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
    p.err { font-size: 13px; color: #ddd; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
    p { font-size: 13px; color: #ccc; }
    label { display: block; margin-top: 11px; font-size: 13px; color: #bbb; }
    input[type=text], input[type=password] {
      width: 100%; padding: 8px; margin-top: 4px; background: #14161c;
      border: 1px solid #3a4250; color: #fff; border-radius: 2px; box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    input[type=submit] {
      margin-top: 18px; width: 100%; padding: 9px; background: #009999;
      color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 2px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px;
    }
    input[type=submit]:hover { background: #00b3b3; }
    .footer { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 11px; color: #667; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <span class="logo">SIEMENS</span>
    <h1>SIMATIC WinCC Web Navigator</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>503 &ndash; Dienst nicht verf&uuml;gbar</h2>
    <p>Die Runtime ist vor&uuml;bergehend nicht erreichbar.</p>
    <div class="footer"><condata source="databus" key="sysName" /> &bull; <condata source="databus" key="ModuleType" /></div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
